quran[7]{c,v,t,f}:
  33,16,"Dheh: Cararku wax idiin ma tarayo, haddaad ka carartaan geeri ama dil, markaas laydiin ku raaxeyn maayo (adduunka) in yar mooyaane."
  33,17,"Dheh: Waa kuma kan idinka qaban kara Alle hadduu idinla doono dhibaato ama idinla doono naxariis? Umana helayaan nafahooda Alle sokadi sokeeye iyo gargaare midna."
  33,18,"Alle waa og yahay kuwa idinka mid ah ee ka reeba (kuwa kale jihaadka Jidka Alle){2}, iyo kuwa ku yidhaahda walaalahood: Noo kaalaya{3}; mana yimaadaan dagaalka in yar ma’ahee.",2:[kale inay taageero siiyaan jihaadka],3:[oo garab istaagaan mujaahidiinta dagaalka.]
  33,19,"Ee bakhayllada ah xaggiinna, markase cabsi timaaddo waxaad arki iyagoo ku soo eegaya oo indhahoodu wareegayaan sida mid la sakaraad ah geeri; markase ay cabsidu tagto, waxay idinku dhibaan carrabyo afaysan, ka bakhaysha khayrka; kuwaasi ma ay rumaynin (Xaqa). Sidaa awgeed buu Alle u buriyey acmaashooda, arrinkaasina Alle wuu u fudud yahay."
  33,20,"Waxay moodaan Axzaabtu inayan tegin{2}, haddayna axzaabtu imaan (mar kale), waxay jeclaan lahaayeen in baadiyaha ay la jiraan reer miyiga oo halkaas ka weydiinayaan wararkiinna; hadday idin dhex joogi lahaayeenna ma ay dagaal galeen in yar ma’ahee.",2:[Cabsidooda zaa’idka ah munaafiqiinta, kuwaasoo fulayo ah, marka ma rumeystaan in ciidammada cadowga la jebiyey.]
  33,21,"Waxaa idiinku sugan Rasuulka Alle tusaale wanaagsan uu raaco mid kastoo rajeeya (la Kulanka) Alle iyo Maalinta Aakhiro, oo xusa Alle in badan."
  33,22,"Markay Mu’minintu arkeen xizbiyadii (gaaladii isu soo baheystay) waxay yidhaahdeen: Kani waa waxay Alle iyo Rasuulkiisu noo yabooheen, Alle iyo Rasuuliisuna run bay sheegeen, umana kordhin waxaan ahayen iimaan iyo hoggaansan."
